<title>UK: BCEE sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>BCEE sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BCEE and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE ET CAISSE D'EPARGNE DE L'ETAT LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    28.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 SPREAD	7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10-50     YTM	   5.62 PCT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
